\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Definition}
\title{Generators chosen at momentum labels}
\date{2026-11-26}

\p{Let a stabilizing group #{G_r} act unitarily on a complex
\vocabk{translation block}{fdip-016C} #{V_r} at a momentum label
#{r}. It can be a subgroup of the
\vocabk{stabilizer}{fdip-0164} or a group of lifts acting on
that block. A \newvocab{choice of cyclic generators} at the
labels under comparison specifies a cyclic subgroup of each
#{G_r} and one of its generators #{a_r}.}

\p{For subgroups of the same order #{\ell\ge1}, use the same
primitive complex #{\ell}th root #{\zeta}. On #{V_r} measure the
\vocabk{cyclic grading}{fdip-016I} using the action of #{a_r}.
A vector of degree #{\nu} has multiplier #{\zeta^\nu}, with
#{\nu\in\mathbb Z/\ell\mathbb Z}. The represented generator
can have order dividing #{\ell}.}
